ore, but I had an idea and wouldlike to run it past you.  We all know that HM is perhaps one of the mostdifficult muds to learn to code on.  The doc files just plain suck, and until now no one was looking to change that.  I have decided to re-write all the doc files (I am toying with the idea of starting from scratch)and eventually making them available on a web site.  Since you are the best coder I have ever worked with, I thought I wouldask you if you would like to help me in this undertaking.  I know youmust help hundreds of coders, and getting a solid programming baseavailable to many on a web site will able you to help that many more.If you have the time and feel this is something you would like to be a part of, please let me know.Willie**dworkin**To: steerpikeSubj: Since I missed youDate: Oct  6Umm.. if you fancy a laugh you could have a look at greebo.unseen.org 4000.It's mike server and has a copy of a modified 2.4.5 and amylaar driver.If you log on, let me know and I'll promote the character (unless youknow of a loophold to do it :) )Simon**dice**To: steerpikeSubj: E-mailCc: DiecDate: Nov  9]Hello ...]I was told your Original name was Moonchild here ...]If so please leave a message here or e-mail dice@euronet.nl]]]Moonchild awas an old friend of mine and i'd like to reestablich contact here :)]]Thanks in advance                        ]Hello ...]I was told your Original name was Moonchild here ...]If so please leave a message here or e-mail dice@euronet.nl]]]Moonchild awas an old friend of mine and i'd like to reestablich contact here :)]]Thanks in advance                        Hello ,.I was told your old name here was MoonchildIf you can you please leave mail  here or to dice@euronet.nlMoonchild was an old friend of mine and i't trying to reestablich contactThanx in advance**dice**To: steerpikeRe:   Hey!Date: Dec 15I actually send you a message, but i think it didn't get throughI'm doing fine the